@startuml PayLinkPaymentState

[*] --> Initiated

Initiated --> FundsHeld : Fraud checks pass\nand sufficient funds
Initiated --> Rejected : Fraud check fails\nor insufficient funds

FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : Payment request sent

SentToBiller --> Completed : Biller confirms
SentToBiller --> Failed : Biller refuses
SentToBiller --> Unknown : No response within 10 seconds

Unknown --> Completed : Biller later confirms\n(callback / retry / settlement)
Unknown --> Failed : Biller later refuses\nor reconciliation finds no payment

Failed --> Refunded : Hold released to wallet

Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

note right of Unknown
  Payment is not refunded automatically.
  The system retries up to 3 times:
  1 minute, 5 minutes, and 15 minutes.
  Then it waits for reconciliation.
end note

note right of Completed
  Final state
end note

note right of Rejected
  Final state
end note

note right of Refunded
  Final state
end note

@enduml